{{Quote|Grants control over sand, with abilities to trap and attack.|Shop}}
'''Sand''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Elemental]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|420,000}} or {{Robux|850}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Sand allows the user to create, become, and manipulate sand. The user can create sandstorms, launch bursts of sand, and create sand traps similar to quicksand, making escape nearly impossible. However, it has a negative-passive when the user comes into contact with [[Water]], similar to realistic circumstances.

==Awakening==
Sand costs {{Fragment|14,500}} to fully awaken.

A [[Titles|Title]] is unlocked upon awakening of the first move from this fruit: "Desert Prince" #043.

