==Trivia==  
* Sand's passive gives the user a disadvantage, in comparison with other passives that usually give the user an advantage.
* Awakened Sand's {{Ability|F|2}} move shares the same name with [[Blizzard]]'s {{Ability|Blizzard|F}} move.
* Sand currently has the slowest [[flight]] move in the game.

